."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"khaled","start":51.605,"text":{"en":"Ask, before you use a machine.","ar":"السؤال، قبل أن تستخدم آلة."},"subHold":7.645,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"khaled","start":59.25,"text":{"en":"Ask before you use a machine.","ar":"اسأل قبل أن تستخدم آلة."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"sami","start":62.12,"text":{"en":"Two rules say do. Two rules say don't.","ar":"قاعدتان تقولان افعل. وقاعدتان تقولان لا تفعل."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"sami","start":66.694,"text":{"en":"Neither one has a subject in front of it.","ar":"ولا واحدة منهما فيها فاعل في المقدّمة."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"sami","start":70.212,"text":{"en":"Now the order. A carpenter joins two pieces of wood.","ar":"الآن الترتيب. نجّار يصل قطعتين من الخشب."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"sami","start":75.29,"text":{"en":"Step one is done: first, measure and cut the wood.","ar":"الخطوة الأولى محلولة: أوّلاً، قِس الخشب واقطعه."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"khaled","start":79.696,"text":{"en":"Which step is second?","ar":"ما الخطوة الثانية؟"},"subHold":6.419,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"khaled","start":86.115,"text":{"en":"Then sand the edges to make them smooth.","ar":"ثمّ اصنفر الحواف لتصبح ناعمة."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"khaled","start":89.513,"text":{"en":"Which step is third?","ar":"ما الخطوة الثالثة؟"},"subHold":6.193,"id":"L019"},{"actor":"khaled","start":95.706,"text":{"en":"Next, put glue on the two pieces.","ar":"بعد ذلك، ضع الغراء على القطعتين."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"khaled","start":98.984,"text":{"en":"Which step is fourth?","ar":"ما الخطوة الرابعة؟"},"subHold":6.371,"id":"L021"},{"actor":"khaled","start":105.355,"text":{"en":"Finally, hold the pieces with a clamp until the glue dries.","ar":"أخيراً، أمسك القطعتين بمِشبك حتّى يجفّ الغراء."},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"sami","start":110.313,"text":{"en":"Measure and cut. Sand. Glue. Clamp.","ar":"قِس واقطع. اصنفر. الصق. اشبك."},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"sami","start":116.447,"text":{"en":"The sequencer tells you the step is not the first.","ar":"كلمة الترتيب تخبرك أنّ الخطوة ليست الأولى."},"id":"L024"},{"actor":"sami","start":120.421,"text":{"en":"Sand before you glue. Glue sticks badly to a rough edge.","ar":"اصنفر قبل أن تلصق. الغراء يلتصق بصعوبة على حافّة خشنة."},"id":"L025"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"7b4273a3ab1f1334","bytes":39024,"sha":"be6d55a057c7a091","address":"lines/7b4273a3ab1f1334.mp3"},{"key":"2153fde0902a6238","bytes":38160,"sha":"4a2356a51588a8cb","address":"lines/2153fde0902a6238.mp3"},{"key":"b8e4eaae94f4d96a","bytes":25056,"sha":"43c115dacc3d302b","address":"lines/b8e4eaae94f4d96a.mp3"},{"key":"bd9b33805a1ba2c5","bytes":22752,"sha":"c7e6cd8528b1d125","address":"lines/bd9b33805a1ba2c5.mp3"},{"key":"33024485af436fc1","bytes":16128,"sha":"2530d100d9c1c5a5","address":"lines/33024485af436fc1.mp3"},{"key":"ec4ea469a4392c7d","bytes":13968,"sha":"4955f96ab3860721","address":"lines/ec4ea469a4392c7d.mp3"},{"key":"31e4ee0747cdeff9","bytes":15408,"sha":"b6c46d0e39926f11","address":"lines/31e4ee0747cdeff9.mp3"},{"key":"e6cea2c35b5fc6d2","bytes":13536,"sha":"944670b0cde9f035","address":"lines/e6cea2c35b5fc6d2.mp3"},{"key":"9614188847820164","bytes":14832,"sha":"b513f7a606e12654","address":"lines/9614188847820164.mp3"},{"key":"800a3a8bc96e2a3f","bytes":13248,"sha":"320fdbacc2711f03","address":"lines/800a3a8bc96e2a3f.mp3"},{"key":"3d04e0d632c063c1","bytes":17280,"sha":"230734f8210c946e","address":"lines/3d04e0d632c063c1.mp3"},{"key":"6d68d062dc75a813","bytes":15120,"sha":"f1b51afe3bacc038","address":"lines/6d68d062dc75a813.mp3"},{"key":"55388bfb93ce8e8c","bytes":25344,"sha":"ce24a741dcb1c19e","address":"lines/55388bfb93ce8e8c.mp3"},{"key":"73af7a0d4718d2e4","bytes":19008,"sha":"b011dab43a80f090","address":"lines/73af7a0d4718d2e4.mp3"},{"key":"14bf463b30f218e8","bytes":28368,"sha":"50e23198fb9f7674","address":"lines/14bf463b30f218e8.mp3"},{"key":"56d992c73219f1